{
  "refId": "1284376",
  "name": "Sonalis Consumer Products Ltd",
  "url": "https://appetitefood.in",
  "about": "Incorporated in 2022, Sonalis Consumer \n Products Ltd is a manufacturer, retailer, \nand a wholesaler of Snacks[1]",
  "keyPoints": "Product Categories:[1]\na) Granola Bar: \nThese products are crafted from 100% fruits and nuts cooked in honey in bar form. Its offerings in this category include C-Bars, IMU-Bars, O-Bars, Pro-Bars, and Ragi Bars, all sold under brand Appetite Food\nb) Laddu:\n These are spherical products made from \n grains, pulses, nuts, dry fruits, and healthy \n oils. Its lineup includes Mithi Laddu, Multigrain Laddu, Mung Laddu, Oats Laddu, Ragi Laddu, \n and Spirulina Laddu, all created from various whole-grain flours, ghee, jaggery, dry fruits, \n and nuts, without the addition of preservatives, flavors, or colors.\nc) Chakli: \nChakli is a deep-fried snack crafted from rice flour, gram flour, wheat flour, or a combination\nof lentil flours.\nd) Chivda: \nThis snack is made with flattened rice (rice \n flakes /poha), peanuts, daliya dal, cashew \n nuts, raisins, and spices. It offers a healthy alternative to high-cholesterol \nandsugar rich products.\ne) Sev: \nSev is a crispy noodle-type snack made from gram flour\nf) Other Products:\nCompany has introduced a new range of millet-based Bars and Laddus for export in 2023. It is already in discussions with companies such as Vgrowfarms, Home Story, and importers from United States and Europe for third-party private label arrangements.",
